 "blocksHtml": "<div class=\"js-grid-slider mb-5 mb-10@sm overflow-hidden user-select-none\" data-cursor=\"drag\" data-cursor-progress=\"0\" style=\"touch-action: pan-y\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"d-flex items-center\" style=\"user-select: none;\">\n<div class=\"w-1/2 w-1/4@sm mr-5 mr-8@sm flex-no-shrink pointer-events-none\">\n<div class=\"mb-2\" style=\"perspective: 1000px;\">\n<div class=\"js-grid-slider-text\">\n<h2 animate-from=\"preset: 'fadeUp'\" class=\"mb-1 t-500 t-lh-1.1 t-uppercase t-ls-tight t-base\">Initial R&amp;D</h2>\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">A summary of initial ideas that were created during the early stages of the project, some of which led us to the final outcome.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none js-slider-items\">\n<div class=\"d-flex mb-4\"><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(-13%, 3%)\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"-50\" dom2webgl=\"image26749871\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Concept.jpg\"/></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(13%, -12%)\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"200\" dom2webgl=\"image27283298\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/shot-book-opening-2_0115.jpg\"/></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(-11%, -11%)\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"-200\" dom2webgl=\"image26751309\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Concept-1.jpg\"/></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(7%, -4%)\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"20\" dom2webgl=\"image26794922\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/image-38.jpg\"/></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(2%, -6%)\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"20\" dom2webgl=\"image27273918\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/shot-close-2_0207.jpg\"/></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(13%, 10%)\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"-120\" dom2webgl=\"image26854389\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Screenshot-2024-01-24-093058.png\"/></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(13%, 6%)\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"-100\" dom2webgl=\"image26817157\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/image-40.jpg\"/></div></div><div class=\"d-flex\"><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(11%, 13%)\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"30\" dom2webgl=\"image27252910\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/bts.jpg\"/></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(-4%, 6%)\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"-40\" dom2webgl=\"image2676731\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Concept-2.jpg\"/></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(-15%, -7%)\"><video alt=\"\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"-1\" dom2webgl=\"image27231190\" draggable=\"false\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Solare-Footer1.mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(-5%, 8%)\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"260\" dom2webgl=\"image26842725\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Screenshot-2024-01-24-093011.png\"/></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(-5%, -3%)\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"140\" dom2webgl=\"image26774087\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/gardens-header.jpg\"/></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(-1%, -4%)\"><video alt=\"\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"50\" dom2webgl=\"image27229084\" draggable=\"false\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Book-Spin.mp4\"></video></div></div> </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Scroll-Through.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image2694\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"grid flex-no-wrap@sm items-center\">\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-10/12@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"t-1.3 t-2.25@sm t-300 t-lh-1.2 t-ls-tight\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nCasa di Solare<br/>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-10/12@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\n<br/>\nA digital oasis and home to the beautiful new font family by Nikolas Type. When Nikolas approach us with this project we jumped at the opportunity to push the boundaries of what a typography showcase could be. Taking inspiration from the font name “Solare” and the origins of it’s design, the sun and it’s magical power has highly influenced all aspects of the website, from sun dial text displays to the striking yellow tones in the UI.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image27216aaa7697720c3\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/mock-up.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image27006aaa76977828b\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/02-home-topaz-high-fidelity-v2-1x.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglParallaxEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image27016aaa76977ce3c\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/03-quote-topaz-high-fidelity-v2-1x.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"grid flex-no-wrap@sm items-center\">\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Book-Shot.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image2687\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-10/12@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"t-1.3 t-2.25@sm t-300 t-lh-1.2 t-ls-tight\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nReal-time &amp; Pre-rendered<br/>\n– A Perfect 3D Partnership\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-10/12@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\n<br/>\nThrough the combination of pre-rendered 3D visuals and real-time WebGL implementation we were able to create a compelling and immersive narrative. Initially introducing the scene in a real-time 3D environment with interactive features then supplementing this with high-quality 3D media created in Cinema4D &amp; Redshift, all of which stylistically share the same common themes which ultimately results in a consistent visual story that feels very custom to the project.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/bandicam-2024-02-12-11-42-27-741.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image2713\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglParallaxEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image26936aaa769786f41\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/daytime.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/bandicam-2024-02-12-11-46-24-645.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image2714\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/bandicam-2024-02-12-14-29-42-067.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image2716\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglParallaxEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image27176aaa76978c053\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Grid-shot.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"container d-flex@sm items-center justify-center mb-5 mb-20@sm\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/3@sm mb-6 mb-0@sm relative\">\n<div class=\"aspect aspect--1/1 aspect--3/2@sm\">\n<div animate-from=\"y: function() { return store.mq.sm.matches ? '0%' : 0 }, rotationY: 30, rotationZ: 3, scrollTrigger: { scrub: 0.5, once: false }\" animate-to=\"y: function() { return store.mq.sm.matches ? '30%' : 0 }, rotationY: 10, rotationZ: -3\" class=\"aspect__child\" data-tex-type=\"image\" dom2webgl=\"c:PhoneModel\">\n<img alt=\"\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Frame-36.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/3@sm relative\">\n<div class=\"aspect aspect--1/1 aspect--3/2@sm\">\n<div animate-from=\"y: function() { return store.mq.sm.matches ? '0%' : 0 }, rotationY: -30, rotationZ: -3, scrollTrigger: { scrub: 0.5, once: false }\" animate-to=\"y: function() { return store.mq.sm.matches ? '-10%' : 0 }, rotationY: -10, rotationZ: 3\" class=\"aspect__child\" data-tex-type=\"image\" dom2webgl=\"c:PhoneModel\">\n<img alt=\"\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Frame-37.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/Solare-Footer-Cropped.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"i